        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as a prehistoric Neanderthal bow hunter..</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718170/extras/97d978bddae826e5df3aa8658cd1e2be.poster.avif?t=1763169260\" width=84 height=84 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718170/extras/97d978bddae826e5df3aa8658cd1e2be.webm?t=1763169260\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel to unlimited procedural islands... desert islands, forest islands, and winter islands..</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718170/extras/033d955c830253d650d2f567c72b73db.avif?t=1763169260\" width=480 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunt animals for meat, bones, and fur. Take your shot in first person view..</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718170/extras/bd4948ba52a04dd8f7d79e068ba397d2.avif?t=1763169260\" width=256 height=256 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Provide for your family..</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718170/extras/27aa2f7fd128df6e8ea80f46e50ccdaa.avif?t=1763169260\" width=190 height=196 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunt for rare trophies..</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718170/extras/e5f0be04c5d29765d7d3a62476a1a878.avif?t=1763169260\" width=580 height=68 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Harvest materials, craft new items; pemmican, arrows, armor, and moveable barriers/blinds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718170/extras/31c2dca1709e8b77dd90a2ebd650c905.avif?t=1763169260\" width=384 height=32 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And survive as long as you can, for a chance to take down a rare Mythic beast!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718170/extras/f10d5a3bbca27a7fbebb8dfb1474ded6.avif?t=1763169260\" width=768 height=256 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Animals include:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forest Islands: Deer, wolfs, tigers, bears, bison, moose and elephants + mythic</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Desert Islands: Deer, wolfs, tigers, lions, buffalo, camels and elephants + mythic</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Winter Islands: Deer, wolfs, smiladons, bears, bison, moose and mammoths + mythic</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trophy types include:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Silver</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gold</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diamond</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mythic</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All animals have a chance to spawn in a rare form</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as a prehistoric Neanderthal bow hunter..</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718170/extras/97d978bddae826e5df3aa8658cd1e2be.poster.avif?t=1763169260\" width=84 height=84 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718170/extras/97d978bddae826e5df3aa8658cd1e2be.webm?t=1763169260\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel to unlimited procedural islands... desert islands, forest islands, and winter islands..</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718170/extras/033d955c830253d650d2f567c72b73db.avif?t=1763169260\" width=480 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunt animals for meat, bones, and fur. Take your shot in first person view..</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718170/extras/bd4948ba52a04dd8f7d79e068ba397d2.avif?t=1763169260\" width=256 height=256 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Provide for your family..</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718170/extras/27aa2f7fd128df6e8ea80f46e50ccdaa.avif?t=1763169260\" width=190 height=196 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunt for rare trophies..</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718170/extras/e5f0be04c5d29765d7d3a62476a1a878.avif?t=1763169260\" width=580 height=68 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Harvest materials, craft new items; pemmican, arrows, armor, and moveable barriers/blinds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718170/extras/31c2dca1709e8b77dd90a2ebd650c905.avif?t=1763169260\" width=384 height=32 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And survive as long as you can, for a chance to take down a rare Mythic beast!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718170/extras/f10d5a3bbca27a7fbebb8dfb1474ded6.avif?t=1763169260\" width=768 height=256 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Animals include:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forest Islands: Deer, wolfs, tigers, bears, bison, moose and elephants + mythic</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Desert Islands: Deer, wolfs, tigers, lions, buffalo, camels and elephants + mythic</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Winter Islands: Deer, wolfs, smiladons, bears, bison, moose and mammoths + mythic</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trophy types include:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Silver</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gold</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diamond</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mythic</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All animals have a chance to spawn in a rare form</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>",
